// lexdb_exec: subqueries in FROM and CTEs (WITH): as tables, joined (hash,
// both sides), grouped, nested, in subqueries; scope and shadowing; a CTE
// used twice run once; UNION, INTERSECT, EXCEPT (ALL); WITH RECURSIVE, its
// cycles and max_recursion; LATERAL and FROM subqueries using outer
// queries' columns; the errors. Expected output checked by hand when written.
// expect: create table c (id int primary key, name text, city text) -> CREATE TABLE
// expect: create table o (id int primary key, cust int, amount numeric(8,2), status text) -> CREATE TABLE
